ttest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-25T12:49:02-08:00","id":1356941,"title":"","content":"I'm going to post up mine shortly, but first a disclaimer that I'd prefer to not clog up the actual gift thread with:<br /> <br /> This has been an especially draining holiday period, and that has included most of the last week being one where I have hardly been able to use my laptop at all, between things like travel and it having gone through a period of constantly freezing. I had intended to conclude my work on it today, but a couple of things have come down upon me to render me unable.<br /> <br /> So I'll post it, but it will not be finished to the standard that I intended. I had fixated enough on today as a deadline for it that I am not willing to delay it any further. I believe that what I currently have is adequate, and when I find the time and energy within the next short while I will conclude it.<br /> <br /> That's all I can do for now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-25T17:07:56-08:00","id":1356957,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356949-white-elephant-for-dietaku-carrion-gorge\">My gift for Dietaku, the Lunar Carrion Gorg.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-26T01:13:32-08:00","id":1357000,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356998-white-elephant-bonus-artisans\">Just in case someone ends up with no gift, I wrote these up for a summoner in my gaming group.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-26T16:19:25-08:00","id":1357126,"title":"","content":"Good News <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar775_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"775\" data-vbnamecard=\"775\">Reighnhell</a> ! I just got smacked in the head with inspiration and will in fact get you a bonus gift! I just want someone to proof read it and edit it a bit. But look forward to it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14713-chronos12","name":"Chronos12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14713_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-26T22:04:53-08:00","id":1357167,"title":"","content":"The first few parts of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357160-white-elephant-for-noodle-the-convention-for-disputation-a-sidereal-circle\">The Convention on Disputation</a>, a Sidereal Circle for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar155_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"155\" data-vbnamecard=\"155\">Noodle</a> have been posted. I got ambitious and decided to make a bunch of characters, and as a result, this is taking longer than I hoped. I'll be posting the remaining characters over the next few weeks, as I complete them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-29T11:25:21-08:00","id":1357577,"title":"","content":"Here is <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23809-orukan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"23809\" data-vbnamecard=\"23809\">Orukan</a> 's gift, a collection of monsters, both well-intentioned and ill, for his western campaign. I hope you enjoy!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357576-white-elephant-for-orukan-a-menagerie-of-monsters-of-the-western-seas\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-western-seas</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T00:41:50-08:00","id":1357711,"title":"","content":"The Ninth Annual Exalted White Elephant (what's the concept behind the name btw ?) for TheCountAlucard has been posted, happy Christmas to all of you ! Even though I don't play Exalted anymore since I changed of town, I'm very happy to still browse here.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357546-white-elephant-for-thecountalucard-stories-of-nexus\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357546-white-elephant-for-thecountalucard-stories-of-nexus\"> [White Elephant for TheCountAlucard] : stories of Nexus - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357546-white-elephant-for-thecountalucard-stories-of-nexus\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357546-white-elephant-for-thecountalucard-stories-of-nexus </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> From what I remember, you created Knight Raiton, which is some kind of Batman. I decided to take inspiration from The Joker to make my first enemy, a prince </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":